Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:14.72,Title,0,0,0,0,,《致命弯道》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你太厉害了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, you're great{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,绳索绑好了吗？是的 快爬吧 慢郎中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got the line? Yeah, come up slow folk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道方圆五十英里内半个人影也没 你在对谁鬼叫啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know in 50 miles there isn't anybody. Who are you screaming for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你啊快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.32,0:01:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉我上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull me up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rich{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.92,0:02:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉我上去啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just pull me up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.84,0:02:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别耍贱了 瑞奇 我需要有人拉我一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, don't be a dick, Richie I need a pull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rich{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rich{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:35.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西维吉尼亚州）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:46.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（山地人不朽传奇）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:55.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（近亲交配导致脸部畸形）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:00.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（遗传突变）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:21.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（近亲交配所产生的精神异常）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.44,0:04:40.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（失踪悬赏）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:45.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（筏夫失踪）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:01.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（暴动爆发）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:09.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（失踪人口）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:20.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（登山客失踪）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:25.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（迷路女孩失踪）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:28.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（失踪女孩）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.04,0:05:29.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（本地女孩失踪）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.96,0:05:41.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西维吉尼亚州 绿蔷薇偏僻乡下）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇史托佛和艾蒂丝史密斯 自上周一起就失踪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard Stover and Edith Smith have been missing since last Monday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,截至周末为止尚未返回…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have been failing to return from a weekend at rock…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.00,0:07:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道前面怎么了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got any idea what's going on up here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,前方约五英里处交通堵塞 化学物流的满地都是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traffic jacked about 5 mile up Still chemicals to shit all over the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.12,0:07:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道多久能清除完毕吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea how long it would take to clean up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个小时吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个小时？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.16,0:07:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赶时间？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in a hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我必须赶到罗里 且我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah I need to take to Roli and I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你只能回你车上 重新另抄一条捷径看看啰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you should do is get back in your car pick your short cut one more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 桃乐丝我是克里斯弗林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey Doris, this is Chris Flinn{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下午三点要与凯勒先生面试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have at3 PM an interview with Mr. Keller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.49,0:08:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概会迟到半个钟头 不知道你能不能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm arriving about 30 minutes later, so I wonder if you could…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.08,0:08:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会这样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can it make this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:34.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（距加油站一英里远）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 先生 你们有公共电话吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir Do you have a pay phone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.24,0:09:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这支坏掉了 还有别支电话可以借我打吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's not working. Do you have another phone I can use?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,打长途的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long distance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这里打有哪里不是长途？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What isn't long distance from here, alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.52,0:09:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在对我吼吗 孩子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got wild at me, son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的 先生 我只是… 我有点迟了 我真的需要打通电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, I'm just… I'm running behind, I really need to make a call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我仅有的电话了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that is my only phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 公路上塞车 你知道别条路可以通出去吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, highway road is jammed up. Do you know of another road heading us out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.36,0:09:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.56,0:10:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条山路怎么会像这样涂上颜色？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is this certain mountain road dyed like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是路？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're road?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们还没重印地图呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they ain't go around the paper yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来走这条路约有15、20英里路程 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like it runs in the highway about 15, 20 miles, is that right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说是就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢 保重了 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much Take care, ok?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才需要好好保重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the one gonna need take care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:14.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（熊山路）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉 我刚好…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, I just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚回过头 没注意到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just come from the back, I didn't even see…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.42,0:12:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,分神了 天哪 你可能撞死呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got distracted Oh God, you could die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.64,0:12:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们全都没事吧？是的 你想坐下来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are all OK? Yeah, You wanna sit down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会有脑震荡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might be in a state of shock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.84,0:12:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在干嘛？开车开的那么快 好了 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing? You're driving so god damn fast Alright, alright{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的车怎会停在路中间？因为轮胎破了啊混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was your truck parked in the middle of the road? Because you broke our tyre, you asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.44,0:12:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我会赔偿我撞坏的一切损失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I will pay for everything I've damaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.30,0:12:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 妈的 没错 你要赔偿 那是我妈的车子呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, damn, you're right, you're gonna pay, that's my Mom's car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大伙 这人说会赔的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, friends, the man said he'd pay for it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.00,0:12:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你毁了我的自行车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you killed my bike here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的车胎怎会破了呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you ruin your tyres?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在路中央放置了铁丝网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone left some barb wires in the middle of the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.24,0:12:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢相信竟然有人将它掉在这里 没有人掉了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe someone just dropped it there. Nobody dropped anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:13:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚发现铁丝网一端固定在树后面 是有人故意的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just found found it tied to the tree back there. Somebody did this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的待客之道太差了 该死的混蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their hospitality is worse Redneck assholes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.44,0:13:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我要设法弄支电话 我想后面几英里处有座加油站{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm going to try to find a phone. I think there's a gas station a couple of miles back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna come with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有电话 我刚刚去过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no phone. I was just there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们何不等别人经过呢？像这儿的赛车手一样吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we wait for someone else to come along? Well, like speedracer here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.24,0:13:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我哪里也不去 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not going anywhere. Ok?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去吧 我不知道 我们要留在这里 法兰西…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys go I dont' know, we're gonna stay here, Francine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.52,0:13:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,…好好享受一番 对 那又怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get high Yeah, so what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你叫什么名字？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯弗林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris Flinn{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.88,0:13:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了 克里斯弗林？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hurt, Chris Flinn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.24,0:13:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是骡子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}cause you're the mule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.60,0:13:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那个我来背就行 你决定整部车或什么的就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no I can carry that. You decide the whole car or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们待在这里 也许又会被撞… 你们确定都没事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just stay here, maybe get hit again… You guys sure you're cool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.52,0:13:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们好的很 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're just fine. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚点见了 慢慢抽吧 小捣蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later on. Smoke it up there, skippie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 祝你们愉快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, have fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想被它害死吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want it to kick your ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 刚才发生的事我还心有余悸呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God I can't let out of my head what was just happending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.30,0:14:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你真的没事吗？是的 我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure you're just alright? Yeah, I'm fine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.24,0:14:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来这里做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys doing out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我不知道 事实上我们迷路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, I don't know, actually we're lost{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.68,0:14:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道很多人说我们一直 重覆经历往后的时光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know a lot of people say we've been to some??? experiences, the following moments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像是慢动作前后移动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of feel like moving and turning in slow motion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.48,0:14:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有同感吗？没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you feel like that? No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该告诉你我的声音在正常速度下 真的很小声低沉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should tell you that my voice is really low and down in normal speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.07,0:14:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.96,0:14:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪拿到的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊我爸太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God my Dad's very nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.72,0:14:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抽不完这根{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't finish this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:15:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以想想怎么抽吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we figure how to stone this?{\r}
