Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.40,0:47:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是噩梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bad dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.76,0:47:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？我得休息一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up? I gotta rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.32,0:47:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 各位 你们看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.16,0:48:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.24,0:48:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是了望塔台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a watch tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.56,0:48:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 上面有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, anyone up there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.64,0:48:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想上面没人 没关系 或许有电话或无线电呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think anyone's up there. Doesn't matter, Maybe there's a phone or radio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.92,0:48:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们能看到路面 你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we'll see the road. You're OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.60,0:48:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.16,0:49:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我看不到路及城镇 别站靠窗附近 会被他们看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I don't see any road. The towns are out there Let's not stand by the window, they will see us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.56,0:49:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 我们会死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here We're gonna die{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.52,0:49:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡莉 我要你清醒一下看看周围 拜讬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carly, I need you to come out and look around, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.36,0:50:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 克里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Chris{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.72,0:50:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,洁西 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jess. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.92,0:51:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊是无线电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God, it's a radio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.36,0:51:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西还相当耐用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing works pretty stark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.84,0:51:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么操作吗？让我试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how to use this? Let me try{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.24,0:51:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想还能用 别乱动 继续试试所有频道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it still works. Don't move anything, just keep on all the frequencies they had on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.68,0:51:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人听见吗？我们有紧急事故 有人听见吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can anybody hear me? We have an emergency. Can anybody hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.56,0:51:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们遇上重大紧急事故 拜讬 有人听见吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we have a huge emergency, please, is there anybody hear me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.76,0:51:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人受伤了 我们需要救助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone is injured. We need a help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.08,0:51:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜讬 外面有人听见我吗？喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, is there anybody out that can hear me? Hello{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.60,0:51:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.68,0:51:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 灯光盖住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down Cover the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.16,0:52:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们他们过去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they're passing us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.40,0:52:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是报案中心 收的到吗？你的位置在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is???. Can you copy? Where is your position?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.76,0:52:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗？你们位置在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you copy? Where's your position?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.24,0:52:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚我的位置 帮帮我们就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know my position. Just help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.76,0:52:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听到 请重覆 你的位置在哪 他们来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't copy that, repeat, what is your position. They're coming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.56,0:52:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 我们不知道我们的位置 我们在一座了望塔 一定在北边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, we don't know our position, we're in a watchtower. We must be in north of???{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.28,0:52:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想杀我们 拜讬 他们杀害了我们的朋友 快救救我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's trying to kill us.Please. They've murdered our friends. Help us right now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.84,0:52:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在原地 收到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay there, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.20,0:52:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 收到 请派警察过来 这是紧急事故{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I copy Just bring the police, this is an emergency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.76,0:53:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我搬这个 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me move this, come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.92,0:53:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人中弹了 我们朋友被杀了 拜讬救救我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's been shot, Out friends have been killed. Help us out, please{\r}
