Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.36,0:53:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.92,0:53:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们下去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they're going down.{\r}
