Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.76,0:54:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 喂 有人在吗？听得见我们吗？喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, hello, is there anybody there? Can you hear us? Hello{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.84,0:54:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 他们在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, what are they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.64,0:54:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,失火了 他们想烧死我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on fire They're trying to burn us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.80,0:54:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.32,0:55:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.56,0:55:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来 放开我 放手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here Let go of me, let go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.96,0:55:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁愿跳下去也不愿被烧死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather jump than burn to death{\r}
