Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.92,0:57:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得移动 快点 该死 该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta move. Come on. Shit, shit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.32,0:57:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡莉 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carly, come on.{\r}
