Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.76,1:00:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们要将这混蛋弹到树下 你能抓紧吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause we're gonna knock this fucker out of the tree. Can you hold it?{\r}
