Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.04,1:00:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 等到我停住不动再放手 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, don't let go until I cease, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.64,1:00:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？我去确保一下他会从这边来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going? I'm gonna make sure he comes this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.56,1:00:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你走路不像我这么快 洁西 洁西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't walk as quick as I can. Jessie, Jessie{\r}
