Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.96,1:04:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,…艾凡和法兰西 这个礼拜全体带我出来散散心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Evan and Francine. All for this week to take me out there{\r}
